.SH NAME
QMimeSource \- An abstract piece of formatted data
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qmime.h>\fR
.PP
Inherited by QDragObject and QDropEvent.
.PP
.SS "Public Members"
.in +1c
.ti -1c
